      "description": "Watch Johor Darul Takzim FC vs Chelsea highlights and goals from Friendly on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 9, 2026. The FIFA Club World Cup delivered a spectacle of pure drama as two continents collided on the pitch. On August 9, 2026 , Johor DT and Chelsea played out a high-stakes encounter that tested the limits of their endurance and tactical discipline, leaving fans breathless until the final whistle. A Second-Half Surge of Goals After a tightly contested opening period, the match exploded into life during the second half. The tension was palpable as J. Silva and Estêvão both saw yellow cards early on, but the breakthrough for the visitors came in the 62nd minute. Liam Delap showed nerves of steel to convert a penalty, making it 1-2 in favor of Chelsea . The lead, however, was incredibly short-lived as the home side mounted an immediate response. In the 65th minute, Arribas found the back of the net to level the score at 2-2, sending the home crowd into a state of delirium. The game then became a feisty affair, with the referee busy issuing cautions to Nicolas Jackson , A. Cristian , and Geovany Quenda as both teams fought desperately for control of the midfield and the lead. Late Drama and Heartbreak As the clock ticked toward full-time, it appeared that Johor DT was on the verge of a historic upset. In the 86th minute, Bergson produced a moment of magic to score and put his side 3-2 up. It was a goal that felt like a match-winner, but the unpredictable nature of the sport struck again in the dying moments of regulation time. Disaster hit for the hosts in the 89th minute when A. Cristian unfortunately turned the ball into his own net, gifting Chelsea an equalizer and making the score 3-3. Despite the late pressure and a yellow card for R. Watson in stoppage time, neither side could find a decisive seventh goal, ending a remarkable contest that will be remembered for its wild momentum shifts."
